TriMul outgoing forward with a hybrid Triton/cuBLAS pipeline.

The implementation normalizes the input in Triton while casting to fp16, packs the
five input projections into one GEMM, materializes gated left/right tensors in
channel-major layout for fast strided batched GEMM over the sequence dimension,
then applies output normalization/gating. For dim=128 the output normalization,
out gate, and final projection are fused into one Triton tensor-core kernel to
avoid the intermediate tmp tensor and final cuBLAS launch.
